  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danida SPA 2025 - EAGL - Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved protection outcomes for migrants, refugees, and host communities in Hargeisa, Burao, Wajaale, Berbera, and Belet Hawo through protection monitoring, awareness raising, referral services, individual protection assistance, and strengthened local protection systems along the Eastern Migration Route.</narrative>
  </description>
